{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうもね！\n最近みんなどう？\n湯沸かし器\nカチィチィチィッボォっていってる？(ｃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんかなりん(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から録画してあった\n「THE MANZAI」見ました＼^^／\n超絶おもしろい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑いいいですよね！\nHi-Hiさんにはまりました\nしょっぱなから\nHi-Hiさんのネタですが\n中田のブログです｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの芸人さんとかいたら\nよければ教えてください＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男だけのパーティーとか\nどうすればいい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nアイドルDVDで沸くしか！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カウントダウンは起きてる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n毎年、カウントダウン時は\nあけおめーるを送ろうと\n頑張ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/rock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田を待受にしても良い？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田なんかでいいんですか？ヽ(；；)ノ\n是非ヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のさゆりんご。\n「かなりん！いいものあげる♪」\n「えーやだー(-_-)」\n「ほんとにいいもの！」\n「ほんとに？」\n「はい♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/111226_213946.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MIXね…\nはいはい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…可愛いから許す！！(´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いいものあげる♪」\nの笑顔が\n超絶可愛かったよ(´;ω;｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは朝早いので\nもうちょっとしたら寝ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はさゆりんごのおかげで\nいい夢見れそうだな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/apple.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(-ω∩).zZ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}